    "created_at": "2016-03-29T16:10:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-29T16:10:17Z",
    "body": "Hi, all,\nGecko does have this problem, now we would reset the playback rate to 1 in this case. Following the description from the spec, it seems to correct.\n\nHowever, I think to keep playback rate as 2 is a better choice (like blink and webkit did), so I would like to make sure what behavior can meet our expectation. If this behavior is better, maybe we would need to modify the spec to make that paragraph more specific.\n\n@padenot, how do you think? I would like to know your comment here because you modified related code in Gecko.\n\nThanks!\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
