    "created_at": "2016-04-01T09:24:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-01T09:24:10Z",
    "body": "> Like it is now everywhere but in Gecko, play/pause resets the `playbackRate`\n\nWhat do you mean? At least Blink's media controls don't change the `playbackRate` at all.\n\nI'm tempted to just remove the bit quoted in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/956#issue-144208959 from the spec, does anything that that keeping it is of any use? This seems like something that different UAs should be allowed to handle differently if they want to. There's no requirement that every button map to exactly one `HTMLMediaElement` concept, after all.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
